### Modify selection - success (should return 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 5]
}

### Modify selection - no existing selection (should return 400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/matches/2/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

### Modify selection - match not found (should return 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/matches/999/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

### Modify selection - unauthorized (should return 403)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}
